From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:36:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] iommu/arm-smmu-qcom: add ACTLR data for SM8650 and SM8750
 MDSS

Match upstream (present in 7.3): the display context banks on SM8650
and SM8750 get PREFETCH_DEFAULT | CMTLB, as on SM8550. The stock
SM8750 device tree also sets ACTLR 0x1 (CMTLB) for the MDSS stream.
---
 drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c
index 62874b18f..43f2597ea 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c
@@ -47,6 +47,10 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_smmu_actlr_client_of_match[] = {
 			.data = (const void *) (PREFETCH_SHALLOW | CPRE | CMTLB) },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8550-mdss",
 			.data = (const void *) (PREFETCH_DEFAULT | CMTLB) },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8650-mdss",
+			.data = (const void *) (PREFETCH_DEFAULT | CMTLB) },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8750-mdss",
+			.data = (const void *) (PREFETCH_DEFAULT | CMTLB) },
 	{ }
 };
 
